        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming visual novel <i>Yomegami: My Sweet Goddess~</i> , developed by renowned Japanese studio <strong>ALcot</strong> and published by JAST, has officially launched on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a  love story about the daily life of a demon reincarnation and goddesses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/a0a918d391f34e1ff91e768f06d03f30.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: ALcot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: JAST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists: Shira Ichigo / Suimya / Hisama Kumako / Mikeou / Aona Masao (SD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Writers: Soranoshita Hajime / Morry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG: Harunose Fumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: AngelNote</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/58f1dc8326864c9614a8ebbc130bca76.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a peaceful human realm oblivious to the gods’ war, Hayato Narukawa—reincarnation of a demon—arrives in Masaireshin city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasked by his goddess mother Iris to atone through good deeds, he strives to redeem his past life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he seeks a fresh start, a fated kiss with mob boss’s daughter Ichijiku Mikoto risks undoing all his efforts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now entangled with a divine mother, a lovesick mafia heiress, a clumsy class president, and an innocent dog-eared girl, Hayato’s hectic and bittersweet love myth begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4acf1d956dabf998aaef417efe79c307.avif?t=1760098063\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7d78471f08f049386ceeac46f400a3bf.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/f9c9749f0b5f1a6a748800f71d80a375.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4ccb21b39c520a1a8f9fdda99f2016b7.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/10be484b9c2e065cfa03befa94cb6a50.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/5cd7fa401e9d4e043cd76c488a37b5ec.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7f608c21404133d9253d3d4a3a791647.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4a0ad4897afd530f1c85f32683d71840.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=133 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters except the male protagonist are voiced. The volume of each of the four female leads can be adjusted individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key bindings are supported, allowing players to customize shortcut operations according to their personal preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four endings. Depending on your choices, the subsequent plot may lead to different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a character's route has been completed, it can be accessed directly from the route selection screen on the game's start page.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heartwarming visual novel <i>Yomegami: My Sweet Goddess~</i> , developed by renowned Japanese studio <strong>ALcot</strong> and published by JAST, has officially launched on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a  love story about the daily life of a demon reincarnation and goddesses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/a0a918d391f34e1ff91e768f06d03f30.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer: ALcot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publisher: JAST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists: Shira Ichigo / Suimya / Hisama Kumako / Mikeou / Aona Masao (SD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Writers: Soranoshita Hajime / Morry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG: Harunose Fumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: AngelNote</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/58f1dc8326864c9614a8ebbc130bca76.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a peaceful human realm oblivious to the gods’ war, Hayato Narukawa—reincarnation of a demon—arrives in Masaireshin city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasked by his goddess mother Iris to atone through good deeds, he strives to redeem his past life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he seeks a fresh start, a fated kiss with mob boss’s daughter Ichijiku Mikoto risks undoing all his efforts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now entangled with a divine mother, a lovesick mafia heiress, a clumsy class president, and an innocent dog-eared girl, Hayato’s hectic and bittersweet love myth begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4acf1d956dabf998aaef417efe79c307.avif?t=1760098063\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7d78471f08f049386ceeac46f400a3bf.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/f9c9749f0b5f1a6a748800f71d80a375.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4ccb21b39c520a1a8f9fdda99f2016b7.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/10be484b9c2e065cfa03befa94cb6a50.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/5cd7fa401e9d4e043cd76c488a37b5ec.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/7f608c21404133d9253d3d4a3a791647.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294690/extras/4a0ad4897afd530f1c85f32683d71840.avif?t=1760098063\" width=800 height=133 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters except the male protagonist are voiced. The volume of each of the four female leads can be adjusted individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key bindings are supported, allowing players to customize shortcut operations according to their personal preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four endings. Depending on your choices, the subsequent plot may lead to different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a character's route has been completed, it can be accessed directly from the route selection screen on the game's start page.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "&quot;Yomegami: My Sweet Goddess!&quot; is a lighthearted visual novel set in a fantasy world, developed by ALcot. It tells a love story about a demon reincarnation with a goddess mother, a mob boss's daughter, a clumsy class president, and a naive dog-eared girl in their daily lives❤",
